    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "Amends Statecraft's run, adapter, acceptance, command, and governance-producer contracts so one task may bind immutable spec-spine context packets from several independently identified repository snapshots, record intended and provider-visible delivery separately, and judge packet integrity, closure, freshness, citations, and evidence without reimplementing producer-owned selectors, closures, or digests.\n",
